                        className="bg-white border border-stone-200 text-stone-605 hover:border-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 p-3 rounded-full shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-200 flex items-center justify-center focus:outline-none"
                        title="ย้อนกลับไปหน้าหมวดหมู่"
